Properties. By construction, HiFD satisfies:
(i) boundedness , HiFD ∈ [ 0 , 1 ] \text{{HiFD}}\in[0,1] ;
(ii) monotonicity , improving any component increases the score;
(iii) vetoing , the harmonic mean drives the score toward zero when any single component approaches zero;
(iv) graceful degradation across modalities via L L ;
(v) annotation-free , every component depends only on estimator outputs on 𝐱 \mathbf{x} and 𝐱 ^ \hat{\mathbf{x}} .

